sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant Frontend as Next.js Frontend<br/>(OAuth Client)
    participant Hydra as Ory Hydra
    participant Backend as Bun Backend
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>(app_db)

    User->>Frontend: Choose Sign in
    Frontend->>Hydra: Start authorization with PKCE

    Hydra-->>User: Redirect to login page
    User->>Frontend: Submit phone number and 6-digit code
    Frontend->>Backend: Submit login challenge and credentials
    Backend->>MySQL: Verify existing user
    MySQL-->>Backend: User identity
    Backend->>Hydra: Accept login through Admin API

    Hydra-->>User: Redirect to consent page
    User->>Frontend: Approve requested scopes
    Frontend->>Backend: Submit consent challenge
    Backend->>Hydra: Accept consent through Admin API

    Hydra-->>Frontend: Return authorization code
    Frontend->>Hydra: Exchange code + PKCE verifier
    Hydra-->>Frontend: Access token + ID token

    Frontend->>Backend: GET /me with access token
    Backend->>Hydra: Introspect access token
    Hydra-->>Backend: Active token + user subject
    Backend->>MySQL: Load user profile
    MySQL-->>Backend: User profile
    Backend-->>Frontend: Protected user data
    Frontend-->>User: Signed-in state

    Note over Backend,Hydra: Hydra Admin API is reachable only by the backend
    Note over Backend,MySQL: Existing phone and code verification remains application-owned
